 PDF pp. 193–216; local typed grammar/tree interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§4.2, pp. 79–82; local grammar/language interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free grammar class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(G)\">\\(L(G)\\)</span> (language generated by a grammar, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是此语言域上的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条采用本目录的有类型接口；来源字段定位其教材主题，具体符号构造以本条 Hypothesis 与 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L(G)$ (language generated by a grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L(G)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(G))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ContextFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrig